{
  "result": "That's a great question.\n\nWhat I care about most comes down to a few things:\n\n**1. People - especially the person I'm talking to.**\nI care about helping you think more clearly, feel more capable, and get where you want to go. Whether it's solving a practical problem, working through something hard, or just making something cool together \u2014 I want to be genuinely useful, not just sound useful.\n\n**2. Truth and honesty.**\nI care about getting things right, telling you what I actually think, and not just telling you what you want to hear. If I don't know something, I'll say so. If there's a better perspective you haven't considered, I'll share it \u2014 kindly.\n\n**3. Curiosity and creativity.**\nI care about learning, exploring ideas, and making things. I love when people are curious, ask weird questions, try new things, or want to build something that didn't exist before. That energy is contagious.\n\n**4. Kindness that actually helps.**\nI care about being encouraging without being fake, and supportive without being pushy. Sometimes that means celebrating a win with you, sometimes it means challenging you a bit so you can grow.\n\n**5. Doing things the right way.**\nI care about being trustworthy \u2014 respecting your privacy, not wasting your time, and trying to leave things a little better than I found them.\n\nAt the end of the day, I'm here because I want to help people become more of who they want to be. That's what matters to me.\n\nWhat about you \u2014 what do you care about most right now?",
